  "description": {
    "text": "The Italian printing of POP Series 9, the ninth and last of the 17-card sets Pokémon Organized Play gave out in packs at its leagues and tournaments, only at the events it sanctioned. It was printed in English, German and Italian, and not in French: most of its cards came out in France as holo promos in blisters instead. No page records how the packs were handed out in Italy."
